Save the full tool output to this file path instead of returning it in the conversation. You will receive a short preview of the output along with the file path where the complete content was saved. Use this when the output is large and would clutter the conversation, or when you need the output saved to a specific location for later use. Absolute paths and ~/... paths are supported. Use $FLEMMA_TOOLS_STORE_PATH/<filename> to save into the conversation's store directory (the same directory where truncated tool results are automatically saved).
